Z||000000||TheFiero64||03-04-2001||10:35 AM||||Just a reminder that <B>Sat the 17th</B> there is a 1 year anniversary meeting of NEFA(New England Fiero Association) If anyone wants to join you are welcome to come by. I have so much <B>fun with this great group of people.</B> We are a very active club and the club goes to countless events around the New England area. Just click on my pics at the bottom of this post to see some of the pics from my adventures. <P>The meeting will be at the great Kick Hill Farms. You can <B>explore the 3 story barn of parts</B> from over 450 Fieros and buy some if you like. Also I know some of us will be bringing our cars out for this event.<P><B>Hope to see many new faces there.</B><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><P>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 03-07-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 03-15-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||KRMFiero||03-04-2001||11:03 AM||||How much is it? What do you get by becoming a member... I am interested though<P>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000002||TheFiero64||03-04-2001||11:33 AM||||It is $12 per year which is non-profit and covers the mailings. You get newsletters, a pride online mailing list for the members only, a lot of events and get-togethers. It is like a big family. We all have such a great time together talking about and looking at each others Fieros. We also allow each of the members to make the choices of the club. If you want to plan something the club will stand behind you 100%. I think Chris Hatch is planning some Rally fun down the Cape this year. We also have an <B>Annual Swap Meet and Fall Foliage Cruise. </B> I would love to welcome some new faces to the family this year. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> We will soon have shirts and other Fiero related wear with the club logo on it.<P>Our club Web site is <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A> <P>We are also affiliated with Mid Atlantic Fiero Owners Association (MAFOA). For $2 extra you can have the excitement of both clubs.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||10
Z||000003||Kevin-84SE||03-04-2001||06:46 PM||||Josh, I would like to join the club, I am going to try to make it to Kick Hill on Saturday.<P>   Thanks,<BR>   Kevin<BR>||||reg||7
