Z||000007||TheFiero64||03-07-2001||12:08 PM||||The NEFA 1st Birthday Annual Meeting has been postponed!<P>** New Date:  Saturday, March 17th at 11:00 AM<P>** Location:  Kick Hill Farm in Lebanon, CT<P>Check the agenda and directions on the club web site: <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa_meeting.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieropride.com/nefa_meeting.htm</A> <P>Other than the date, everything is the same.<P>If you haven't yet renewed your membership, bring it with you. Feel free<BR>to also bring any new members. Lets get everybody involved.<P>Ray Paulk, President<BR><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg"> <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
